WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Standing light punch begins the four-button target route.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.850
The heavy-kick target continuation knocks Ryu down.

3
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.650
Kimberly spends one can to place the medium bomb after the knockdown.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.650
The planted bomb remains at Ryu’s feet as he recovers.

5
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.500
The planted bomb explodes after the target knockdown, as a separate hit sequence.
